Q(11,'workedExample','HTTP-01 validates the challenge response reached by the CA. Diverse remote perspectives reduce the chance that one localized routing attack controls enough observations. The Baseline Requirements use dated minimum perspective counts and quorum rules; they do not require unanimous agreement in every configuration. As of the5October2026review, the June2026 requirement is at least4remote perspectives, increasing to5from15December2026. CAA can constrain compliant issuance and CT monitoring can help detect unexpected certificates.',src=[ca])
